        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Epic and Lyric",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nPARRY'S OBSERVATION\n-------------------\nHomer's language is full of repeated phrases:\n  \"swift-footed Achilles\"\n  \"rosy-fingered Dawn\"\n  \"wine-dark sea\"\n  \"Athena of the flashing eyes\""
    },
    {
