        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Epic and Lyric",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Not style. Not laziness. Not oral memory of fixed text.\nThese are generative units for composition in performance.\n```"
    },
